config CRYSTALHD
	tristate "Broadcom Crystal HD video decoder (BCM70012, BCM70015)"
	depends on PCI && DMA_SHARED_BUFFER
	help
	  The Broadcom Crystal HD H.264, VC-1 and MPEG-2 decoders, on mini PCIe
	  cards such as the AzureWave AW-VD920. Userspace drives the card through
	  /dev/crystalhd with libcrystalhd, which loads the decoder's firmware.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will be
	  called crystalhd.
